SUMMARY:LEC 46th birthday bash celebration
LOCATION:9704 N Blvd Tampa \, FL 33612 United States
DESCRIPTION:The Life Enrichment Center (LEC) is celebrating its 46th anniv
 ersary by hosting an open house and art sale extravaganza on November 7\, 
 2026 from 10:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. on the LEC grounds at 9704 North Bouleva
 rd in Tampa\, Florida. The Saturday celebration includes an open house\, a
 rt sale\, and basket raffle until 2:00 p.m.\, at which time the basket raf
 fle winners will be announced. The public is invited to attend this free e
 vent. Since its founding in 1980\, theprivate non-profit organization has 
 maintained a singular focus: inspiring adults 55 throughout Hillsborough C
 ounty and surrounding areas to explore their creative potential through me
 aningful engagement in the arts while supporting their social\, emotional\
 , and physical well-being. The Life Enrichment Center proudly celebrates 4
 6 years of service through creativity\, community\, and connection. \n\nPe
 rmalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196361
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196361
END:VEVENT
