SUMMARY:Ghana Day in Tampa Bay (Ghana Fest Florida 2026)
LOCATION:2401 E Yukon Street Tampa \, FL 33604 United States
DESCRIPTION:Ghana Day in Tampa Bay is a vibrant community celebration hono
 ring Ghanaian culture\, heritage and the contributions of Ghana and the Af
 rican diaspora\, through music\, food\, fashion\, history and the arts\, t
 he festival creates a welcoming place for people to connect\, learn and ce
 lebrate together. Presented by the Ghanaian Association of Tampa Bay\, Gha
 na Fest Florida 2026 promotes cultural awareness\, unity and meaningful co
 nnections across Tampa Bay and beyond. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.go
 v/node/195856
