SUMMARY:Honor Our Veterans: Free Admission on Veterans Day
LOCATION:1630 East 7th Avenue Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate and get free entry as we honor the heroes who s
 erved on Veterans Day weekend! In honor of Veterans Day\, FMoPA is pleased
  to offer free admission to all veterans and active duty military . Come e
 xplore the museum and enjoy our current exhibitions as we celebrate and re
 cognize those who have served our country. Veterans must present a valid m
 ilitary or veteran ID at the front desk to receive free admission. \n\nPer
 malink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/195916
