SUMMARY:Veterans Health Hackathon
LOCATION:211 N Tampa St Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:The annual three-day Veterans Health Hackathon brings together
  Veterans\, clinicians\, technologists\, entrepreneurs\, and innovators to
  form interdisciplinary teams that ideate\, build\, and pitch AI-powered s
 olutions to VAs top strategic priorities and complex challenges in Veteran
  carefrom clinical decision-making to operations and patient outcomes. The
  Hackathon creates a fast-paced\, collaborative environment where creativi
 ty\, emerging technologies\, and a commitment to service drive transformat
 ive innovation for Veteran care. The most promising concepts advance to th
 e next stage of the Veterans Health Venture Studio innovation cycle. Seaso
 ned mentors will guide teams as they address real-world problems. Independ
 ent judges will then evaluate each teams concept\, with winners advancing 
 to additional stages for further concept validation and prototype solution
 . This event is open to any innovator looking to advance Veteran health ca
 re. The priority application deadline closes October 28\, 2026 with a roll
 ing application period until November 4\, 2026. Learn More Apply Today: ht
 tps:dvagov-vhventures-prod-portal.powerappsportals.us (https:dvagov-vhvent
 ures-prod-portal.powerappsportals.us) \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov
 /node/196971
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196971
END:VEVENT
