LOCATION:3008 W Heiter St Tampa \, FL 33607 United States
DESCRIPTION:Explore West Tampa Heights\, formerly known as the Stadium Are
 a\, and shop neighborhood yard sales featuring a wide variety of items\, i
 ncluding clothing\, furniture\, home dcor\, toys\, books\, tools\, collect
 ibles\, kitchen items\, electronics\, and more. Participating households w
 ill be located throughout the neighborhood. Look for red balloons marking 
 participating homes and enjoy a morning of bargain hunting while supportin
 g the local community. Event Details Date: Saturday\, November 14\, 2026 T
 ime: 8:00 AM3:00 PM Location: West Tampa Heights (formerly the Stadium Are
 a) Admission: Free Parking: Street parking is available throughout the nei
 ghborhood\\\; please be mindful of driveways\, sidewalks\, and residential
  access. Support the Neighborhood The event is organized by the West Tampa
  Heights Neighborhood Association (WTHNA) . Sale proceeds go directly to p
 articipating households. Bring your shopping bags\, invite your friends an
 d family\, and come discover some great finds in West Tampa Heights! West 
 Tampa Heights Neighborhood Association \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.go
 v/node/196006
