SUMMARY:Strong Over Fifty Experience at Armature Works
LOCATION:1910 N Ola Ave Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:The Strong Over 50 Experience is a free community health and w
 ellness event designed for adults ages 50 across Tampa Bay. Hosted at Arma
 ture Works\, the event will feature instructor-led fitness and movement ac
 tivities\, health and wellness vendors\, healthy snacks\, giveaways\, soci
 al activities\, and resources focused on helping older adults stay active\
 , strong\, healthy\, and independent. The event will also include an offic
 ial attempt to break the Guinness World Record for the Largest Senior Citi
 zens Health Awareness Lesson \, bringing hundreds of adults 50 together fo
 r an interactive health education and movement experience. \n\nPermalink: 
 https://www.tampa.gov/node/194906
