 wk Winery
LOCATION:4110 W Boy Scout Blvd Tampa \, FL 33905 United States
DESCRIPTION:The LiveLung Tampa chapter is a community for anyone impacted 
 by lung cancersurvivors and care partners alike. We meet in person on the 
 third Wednesday of each month at 11:00 a.m. ET. This November well be kick
 ing off the holidays and recognizing National Lung Cancer Awareness Month 
 with special guest Dusty Donaldson\, founder of LiveLung and lung cancer s
 urvivor. Enjoy a wonderful complimentary lunch full of fellowship\, fun an
 d inspiration for lung cancer survivors and care givers at Coopers Hawk Wi
 nery Restaurant-4110 W Boy Scout Blvd Tampa\, FL 33607 at 11:30 am. And Du
 sty will have swag and a special gift for all attendees! Wed love for you 
 to join us! Free lunch is provided\, so be sure to register and place your
  order at least 48 hours in advance. Register here - https:livelung.linkli
 velungtampab2ef4a (https:www.google.comurl?qhttps:livelung.linklivelungtam
 pab2ef4a saD sourcecalendar usd2 usgAOvVaw3bC7xftG62oJR3HQMCVGrG) or call 
