SUMMARY:Run Hard Youth 5k
LOCATION:6901 S MacDill Ave Tampa \, FL 33611 United States
DESCRIPTION:Lace up for the Run Hard Youth 5K at Gadsden Park in South Tam
 pa! This race is just for kids in 8th grade and younger\, from first-time 
 runners to fast finishers. Every youth runner who crosses the finish line 
 receives a finisher medal\, and well award the top runners in each grade\,
  from 1st grade and younger through 8th grade. Parents are welcome to run 
 alongside their child with a parent registration. Run Hard is a nonprofit 
 after-school program that trains students to complete a 5K while building 
 character along the way. Come cheer on the kids\, or run with them! Youth 
 registration is 25 through October 31\, then the price goes up. \n\nPermal
