SUMMARY:2027 Tampa Oyster Fest
LOCATION:5818 Causeway Blvd Tampa \, FL 33619 United States
DESCRIPTION:Tampa Oyster Fest is the community event Tampa Bay looks forwa
 rd to all year. Fresh oysters\, live music\, cold drinks\, great food\, an
 d even better company\, all in one unforgettable afternoon that does a lot
  of good to support Tampa Bay kids. This is a must-attend event that sells
  out fast. Whether youre an oyster connoisseur or just in it for the good 
 vibes\, Tampa Oyster Fest delivers a one-of-a-kind experience that keeps p
 eople coming back year after year. Tampa Oyster Fest is produced by and be
 nefits Frameworks of Tampa Bay\, the leading nonprofit in our community de
 dicated to equipping every child with emotional intelligence\, the skills 
 they need to navigate any emotion\, conversation or situation\, no matter 
 how difficult. When you join us at Tampa Oyster Fest\, youre having more t
 han a great time. Youre helping ensure children across Tampa Bay have the 
 knowledge and know-how to become kind\, collaborative\, and capable citize
 ns. Every ticket. Every oyster. Every round. It all adds up to a stronger 
 Tampa Bay. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196171
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196171
END:VEVENT
