SUMMARY:Tampa Tastings
LOCATION:401 E Jackson St #101 Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:WHOS READY FOR A WHOLE NEW WAY TO EXPERIENCE TAMPAS FOOD SCENE
 ?! One evening. Multiple restaurants. A delicious adventure thats entirely
  YOURS! Imagine an evening filled with incredible food\, new discoveries\,
  and the freedom to follow your cravings wherever they take you! Start wit
 h something savory. Wander over to another restaurant for a delicious spec
 ialty. Discover a hidden gem youve been meaning to try. Finish the night w
 ith something sweet or keep exploring!  Why settle for one restaurant when
  you could experience several?! Introducing TAMPA TASTINGS \, an exciting 
 new monthly restaurant-hopping experience coming to Tampa\, Temple Terrace
 \, and Ybor City! Whether youre planning a memorable date night\, looking 
 for something different to do with friends\, enjoying a family outing\, or
  treating yourself to a little culinary adventure\, Tampa Tastings brings 
 a fresh twist to your usual night out!  HERES HOW THE ADVENTURE WORKS! TAS
 TE YOUR WAY THROUGH TAMPA! Explore participating local restaurants\, each 
 featuring specially selected\, tasting-sized dishes for you to discover an
 d enjoy! From savory favorites to sweet indulgences\, every stop brings an
  opportunity to try something delicious. COLLECT YOUR TASTING CREDITS! Bef
 ore the event\, choose how many tasting credits youd like. Each credit can
  be exchanged for a featured tasting at a participating restaurant. Planni
 ng a bigger food adventure? Discounted credit bundles will be available\, 
 giving you even more reasons to explore! YOU CHOOSE THE STOPS! No guided t
 ours\, no set restaurant order\, and no rushing from place to place! Pick 
 the restaurants that catch your eye\, follow your cravings\, and enjoy the
  evening at your own pace. DISCOVER YOUR NEXT FAVORITE! Maybe youll fall i
 n love with a dish youve never tried. Maybe youll finally visit that resta
 urant youve been curious about. Or maybe youll discover a new go-to spot y
 ou cant wait to tell everyone about! And while youre enjoying every bite\,
  youll also be supporting the local restaurants that make our communitys f
 ood scene so special!  SAVE THE DATE! MONDAY\, JANUARY 25\, 2027 5:00 PM  
 9:00 PM Tampa  Temple Terrace  Ybor City This is a restaurant-hopping expe
 rience held at multiple participating restaurants\, not a single event ven
 ue. The restaurant lineup and locations will be announced ahead of the eve
 nt!  DATE NIGHT? GIRLS NIGHT? FAMILY FUN? SOLO ADVENTURE? YES TO ALL OF IT
 ! Make it romantic. Make it a group adventure. Bring the family. Or enjoy 
 a little time treating yourself! Whether you visit a couple of restaurants
  or spend the entire evening discovering new flavors\, theres no single wa
 y to experience Tampa Tastings. Your evening. Your cravings. Your adventur
 e! And the excitement doesnt end on January 25! Tampa Tastings is planned 
 to return one Monday evening every month\, bringing fresh opportunities to
  discover local favorites and explore something new!  BE PART OF THE FIRST
 -EVER TAMPA TASTINGS! Were bringing together local restaurants for an even
 ing of delicious discoveries\, and we cant wait to reveal whos joining us!
  Want to be among the first to discover participating restaurants\, see th
 eir featured dishes\, and find out when tasting credits become available? 
 Join our email list and follow along as the inaugural Tampa Tastings exper
 ience comes to life!  JOIN THE EMAIL LIST!  https:gmail.us5.list-manage.co
 msubscribe?uae2da753b50ef5f92dac40548 idcb20542bc5 COME HUNGRY. EXPLORE SO
 METHING NEW. LEAVE WITH NEW FAVORITES! \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.go
 v/node/196836
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196836
END:VEVENT
