SUMMARY:Tampa Fine Art Show by Hot Works
LOCATION:601 Water Street Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Tampa Fine Art Show by Hot Works features quality juried artis
 ts selling their original and personally handmade art. There is something 
 for everyone. Cotanchobee Fort Brooke Park is a beautifully renovated wate
 rfront park in downtown Tampa\, located at 601 Water Street along the scen
 ic Garrison Channel Riverwalk\, directly across from Benchmark Internation
 al Arena (formerly Amalie Arena) home of the Tampa Bay Lightning  and one 
 mile from University of Tampa. The park offers a peaceful oasis for recrea
 tion and relaxation\, featuring convenient Friday move-in access\, modern 
 restroom facilities\, artist amenities\, and ample nearby parking. Overloo
 king the park across the channel is Harbour Island\, an upscale residentia
 l community with new developments and striking views of the waterfront. Wi
 th its prime downtown location\, welcoming amenities\, and picturesque set
 ting\, Cotanchobee Fort Brooke Park provides the perfect backdrop for a fi
 ne art and craft show. Hot Works top-notch media and promotional campaign 
 brings patrons specifically with money to spend on art. TV\, radio\, print
 \, digital marketing\, social media\, postcards\, banners\, and more bring
  patrons specifically for the art show. New! Hot Works Tents for Art Shows
  offers for rent Light Dome tents 275\\\; add pro-panels 475 includes set 
 up and tear down! All disciplines of media are accepted . Please apply onl
 y if you make your own work. Hot Works. Your Art. Our Passion . Apply Now!
  https:www.zapplication.orgevent-info.php?ID14787 \n\nPermalink: https://w
 ww.tampa.gov/node/194191
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/194191
END:VEVENT
